    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09441759c722ab87b10885a7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小风，你就继续跑步吧。\n这是我们一起讨论出来的结论。\n所以你就别担心家里的事──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b712270c9b6215bcb6cd1a81006ad971567512b1cba94f2906ef3bf395ac99b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
