    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838061b5421b952007653ae4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我开始打工，寄更多的钱回家。\n但后来她们却开始担心\n我会把身体搞坏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ce6c6779d2206286142cc6aa441c27f85e180e9e0e30526e22944fd3b347f4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
