      "uid": "zhcn:dbdee0328edf3a179c30397e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我本来是想让她们放心的。\n──让她们知道我没有硬撑。我还特地改练\n不会累倒的跑法，就是想让她们不再担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95e9eb397b2468d6dee34dc5b63380a0b81b75157c235c111f19ed1b625b2156",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
